Text BPE tokenization does not measure provider message/tool framing; context
counts explicitly report estimated provenance. Images retain the previous fixed
250-token offline estimate per image (LiteLLM 1.93.0 default), never provider
observations or billing modality usage. Audio/video/file context remains unknown.

